target/
artifacts/

# libFuzzer appends coverage-expanding discoveries to the corpus directories
# during a campaign. Only hand-curated seed files (named `fen-NNN-…` /
# `uci-NNN-…`) are tracked; everything else under `corpus/<target>/` is a
# transient runtime artifact. Plan `docs/plans/tooling-fuzzing.md` §6
# Phase 3 step 6 ("commit only the seed-only corpus") and ADR-0013 §8.
corpus/fuzz_fen/*
!corpus/fuzz_fen/fen-*
corpus/fuzz_uci/*
!corpus/fuzz_uci/uci-*

